<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-17T14:19:25.509Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:19:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF has intensified aerial attacks, striking a market in Darfur that killed at least 30 civilians and a livestock market in Nyala that wounded dozens of women and children, while the SAF blamed the RSF for a separate market bombing in Darfur. RSF militias also attacked a mine in South Kordofan, prompting UN warnings that the warring parties show no serious commitment to a settlement. US officials are urging a humanitarian truce, and the US ceasefire proposal has been criticized as potentially leading to a Libya-style partition. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/17/2550?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNOHFhTUotRHNhR05Uc2kwMVNKczZzLTNtTUlIbXUtZ1hrR1RUdEhtY1pCQmxNbjZ1ZURjTmpyeUQwSDc5V3JVLS11eGZHWUNnYWdsSWphMnVHZ2dCbGpnOHNQR2tJb2pZUkRQSXIzc2UyYWY4TmFkY3RSZmZzNnRVSzRqU3BMV0p2NVhyUzdYRlpReV9HWTdhMnV4eWNyUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxObmtmOXY1TEpqdHQ0OWhyS2pSLURDT0x1dXpJTndCcmdiUWVaTHphbWNLemlFSVliaE5RRW85R21aUGJDbEJyTVFYU19Pc1NjMU1LbEk5LVp1b1lRYnMwV3F6OHdmVXNhZlIzX08yU0ZyWmVwNXYtRVBSTWNFMm1IdDZEV2oxVy1HX0kwOW9lM1JpbnVDM05qS19ZTUQ5VzYxc3RCNFd3NEMyV1l4UnA3THpMUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Garowe Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE41Y0oxa01XZHF4T1NBWHE2NzFNOTZYQ09OM2toQTZHSC12QzBFOG1wT2VJdU9zTEVjaHQ2QjhORF9DSE5QYTFxQk9FMFZIV1BxYktuQkhNU1dISVR1cjdYdnR1RnFYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE92MndEODhiN2NxLXZ5RVpPMDZNLV9RYk0zX2d1akVYdHNRUUw3X29qRWtXYm